      "writtenOn": "2023-07-13T08:59:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It makes sense for FULL to be the default for vm_shell, because otherwise the attempt to connect to the shell will fail.\nI suspect that\u0027s why it is the default for run_microdroid - there\u0027s not a lot of point doing that with debug NONE, since you won\u0027t get any logs and the resulting VM doesn\u0027t do very much.\nvm_shell should definitely continue to use FULL, but that\u0027s a separate script.\nTBH I\u0027d be tempted to make FULL the default everywhere - vm run is primarily a tool we use while debugging. But consistency in either direction is fine by me.\nAny change is likely to break some of our tests, of course.",
